#. type: Title #
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "020 — Package release"
msgstr "020 — Release de pacotes"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Criteria"
msgstr "Critérios"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "No critical issues."
msgstr "Nenhuma issue crítica."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "Public API changes aren't likely. Some time passed w/o issues reported that may require API changes."
msgstr "Mudanças na API pública são improváveis. Já passou algum tempo sem issues relatadas que possam exigir mudanças na API."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "All dependencies are stable."
msgstr "Todas as dependências são estáveis."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "Close to 100% test coverage with, ideally, a 100% MSI score."
msgstr "Cobertura de testes próxima de 100% e, idealmente, score MSI de 100%."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "README is alright."
msgstr "O README está em ordem."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "Everything is type-hinted unless special cases."
msgstr "Tudo tem type hints, exceto em casos especiais."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "Psalm analysis passes on at least level 2."
msgstr "A análise do Psalm passa pelo menos no nível 2."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "phpdoc is alright."
msgstr "O phpdoc está em ordem."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "Public API is alright."
msgstr "A API pública está em ordem."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Release branch policy"
msgstr "Política de branches de release"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "Use `master` for all regular releases."
msgstr "Use `master` para todos os releases regulares."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "Create a separate branch only when releasing a new version for a previous major version. In this case, create the branch from the latest tag in that previous major version line and apply only the changes needed for the release."
msgstr "Crie um branch separado apenas ao lançar uma nova versão de uma versão major anterior. Nesse caso, crie o branch a partir da tag mais recente dessa linha de versão major anterior e aplique apenas as mudanças necessárias para o release."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Release instruction"
msgstr "Instruções de release"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "Release a package via [Yii Development Tool](005-development-tool.md)."
msgstr "Faça o release de um pacote com a [Ferramenta de desenvolvimento do Yii](005-development-tool.md)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. Check that you can sign commits locally (see \n"
"[Signing commits](https://docs.github.com/en/authentication/managing-commit-signature-verification/signing-commits)).\n"
msgstr ""
"1. Verifique se você consegue assinar commits localmente (veja \n"
"[Assinando commits](https://docs.github.com/en/authentication/managing-commit-signature-verification/signing-commits)).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "For regular releases, pull last changes from the `master` branch:"
msgstr "Para releases regulares, faça pull das últimas mudanças do branch `master`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"./yii-dev git/checkout master package-name\n"
"./yii-dev git/pull package-name\n"
msgstr ""
"./yii-dev git/checkout master package-name\n"
"./yii-dev git/pull package-name\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "For previous major version releases, use the branch created according to the release branch policy instead of `master`."
msgstr "Para releases de versões major anteriores, use o branch criado de acordo com a política de branches de release, em vez de `master`."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "Check the package for compliance with the criteria above."
msgstr "Verifique se o pacote atende aos critérios acima."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "Run `release/make` command:"
msgstr "Execute o comando `release/make`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "./yii-dev release/make package-name\n"
msgstr "./yii-dev release/make package-name\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "Select the version type (major, minor or patch)."
msgstr "Selecione o tipo de versão (major, minor ou patch)."

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "On the question \"Push commits and tags, and release on GitHub?\" check a diff. If the diff is alright, answer \"yes.\""
msgstr "Na pergunta \"Push commits and tags, and release on GitHub?\", confira o diff. Se o diff estiver correto, responda \"yes\"."

#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#: ../src/internals/020-package-release.md
msgid "For major and minor releases, add a record with release notes on [Yii Framework News](https://www.yiiframework.com/news)."
msgstr "Para releases major e minor, adicione um registro com as notas de release em [Yii Framework News](https://www.yiiframework.com/news)."
